normalized.text:
{
  "summary": "The RNA-only, multiprofile scVI_n200 configuration with transformer aggregation achieved validation accuracy 0.6530 and F1 0.6283, slightly above the otherwise identical avgpool result of 0.6501 accuracy and 0.6275 F1. This suggests that learned transformer aggregation is competitive with avgpool and may provide a small validation improvement in this RNA-only multiprofile setting. It remains uncertain whether the small difference reflects a meaningful advantage of transformer aggregation or uncontrolled variability, and the result does not yet establish how this setting will perform in more complex multimodal configurations."
}

